			"notes": "## 更新内容\n\n自 `2.0.0-beta.3` 以来的变更：\n\n### 新功能\n\n- 多角色选择界面显示头像与认证服务器名（[`3476fff`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/3476fff)）\n- 外置登录支持多角色选择与绑定（[`aac9b4d`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/aac9b4d)）\n- 明文 HTTP 的认证服务器给出醒目警告（[`aa04b72`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/aa04b72)）\n- 仅在全部账户视图下允许调整账号顺序（[`f05f2e3`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/f05f2e3)）\n- 移除认证服务器时连带删除其账号（[`674a1a6`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/674a1a6)）\n- 源码回落解析器支持 sourceBase 分叉并补规则自检（[`48723af`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/48723af)）\n- 左侧认证服务器列表支持滚动（[`c39e0c0`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/c39e0c0)）\n- 删除当前账号后自动切回默认账号（[`1ea4149`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/1ea4149)）\n- OAuth client_id 改为内置 host 表与 YGGC 共享 ID 两级解析（[`ea022e1`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/ea022e1)）\n- 统一筛选栏与登录界面的选中态，登录界面不再显示 OAuth 链接（[`34fe8d3`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/34fe8d3)）\n- 登录界面收敛为共用骨架，微软与离线改用专用界面（[`2673495`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/2673495)）\n- 微软登录拆为取码与轮询两步（[`ebb7e81`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/ebb7e81)）\n- 认证服务器注册表支持移除条目（[`6207d01`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/6207d01)）\n- 外置认证服务器新增 OAuth/密码登录界面（[`7fa03ea`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/7fa03ea)）\n- device-code 拆为取码与轮询两步并提供登录入口（[`e90037d`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/e90037d)）\n- 重写账号列表为左筛选右列表布局（[`c5c07e2`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/c5c07e2)）\n- 重写 ServerScreen 为双面板布局（筛选+服务器列表）（[`eecc139`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/eecc139)）\n- 在 AccountScreen 添加 Servers 按钮入口（[`cb0e3e9`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/cb0e3e9)）\n- 添加 ServerScreen 与 AccountScreen 服务器入口（[`e4c47d4`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/e4c47d4)）\n- P5.1 去重 PlayerSkinProviderMixin（[`6bc191f`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/6bc191f)）\n- P5.2 接入 AccountListModel 到所有适配器（[`331be4d`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/331be4d)）\n- P5.2 提供 DefaultAccountListModel 实现（[`0d0d70b`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/0d0d70b)）\n- P5.2 接入 PlatformOps seam 到所有适配器（[`4b71111`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/4b71111)）\n- P5.2 接入 PlatformOps seam 到所有适配器（[`0f26ea5`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/0f26ea5)）\n- P5.2 接入 PlatformOps seam 到 1.20 适配器（[`08b5faa`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/08b5faa)）\n- P5.2 引入 PlatformOps 浏览器/剪贴板 seam（[`e9ce923`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/e9ce923)）\n- P5.1 去除 MinecraftClientAccessor/PlayerSkinProviderAccessor 重复副本（[`5b27d6d`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/5b27d6d)）\n- P5.3 提取 YggdrasilUserApiServiceMixin 魔法字符串为常量（[`f623299`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/f623299)）\n- P5.3 提取 YggdrasilUserApiServiceMixin 魔法字符串为常量（[`54a7ced`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/54a7ced)）\n- P5.1 去除 ButtonWidget/DefaultMemory/SplashTextResourceSupplierAccessor 重复副本（[`2d249a1`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/2d249a1)）\n- P5.0 版本源码回落机制试点（[`d6b766c`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/d6b766c)）\n- P4 皮肤材质域名白名单修复（[`7acd567`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/7acd567)）\n- P3.4 新增服务器管理相关 key 并移除死 key（[`0fa4ac2`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/0fa4ac2)）\n- P3.3 适配器接线消费 FormSpec SPI（[`d203d72`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/d203d72)）\n- 落地 P3.2 声明式表单与账号列表 SPI（[`4bf01d1`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/4bf01d1)）\n- 实现 P3.1 账号认证服务器注册表与 Yggdrasil 登录流（[`fa903b0`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/fa903b0)）\n- AccountRepository 接管集合与持久化，完成新存储接线（P2.4）（[`0392221`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/0392221)）\n- 新增标准迁移链与 3→4 UNIFY_AND_DECOUPLE（P2.3）（[`ae9bfb3`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/ae9bfb3)）\n\n..."
		},
