			"notes": "## 更新内容\n\n自 `2.0.0-beta.1` 以来的变更：\n\n### 新功能\n\n- 头像渲染迁出 core 到独立模块（P1.4）（[`f3e826b`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/f3e826b)）\n- 新增 P0.5 架构检查任务——checkArchitecture + validateAdapterMatrix（[`6a90b19`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/6a90b19)）\n\n### Bug 修复\n\n- 修正 authlib 适配器内部 Logger 引用的类（[`93c03ed`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/93c03ed)）\n- 适配器版本号格式改为 依赖版本-项目版本 修复 Fabric 多版本 mod 冲突（[`a1669dd`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/a1669dd)）\n- fabric.mod.json 声明 minecraft >=1.20 依赖并补全结尾换行（[`92c5ed1`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/92c5ed1)）\n- MC 适配器版本以 MC 版本为前缀，修复 CI 因 +build.N 选中错误适配器（[`28d421a`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/28d421a)）\n- cache-cleanup 使用合法枚举值 on-success（[`36f1091`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/36f1091)）\n- 替换已弃用的 gradle-home-cache-cleanup 为 cache-cleanup（[`70e387e`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/70e387e)）\n- 稳定化 TaskSchedulerTest 并行池上界断言（[`9071759`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/9071759)）\n- 修复 upload-artifact 多文件匹配导致构建失败（[`5f22c96`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/5f22c96)）\n- 实现 P1.1 正确性修复（[`a4c3387`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/a4c3387)）\n- 修正 P0.4 测试快照的审查瑕疵（[`359e08b`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/359e08b)）\n- 修复 authlib 产物恢复路径（嵌套 build/libs 结构）（[`599956f`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/599956f)）\n- restoreAdapterArtifacts 用显式 FileFilter 避免 SAM 歧义（[`c16b30e`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/c16b30e)）\n- core job 改用 :jar，移除未实现的 checkArchitecture/validateAdapterMatrix（[`af9b482`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/af9b482)）\n- 修正 .gitignore 误忽略 buildSrc 共享代码（P0.2 漏提交）（[`0d6d1dc`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/0d6d1dc)）\n\n### 重构\n\n- 合并 GUI 图标/头像资源到 core 命名空间并去重适配器副本（[`6fad518`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/6fad518)）\n- 适配器将 assert minecraft != null 改为局部捕获与空判断（[`057b75a`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/057b75a)）\n- AvatarKey 改为 record 并清理头像持久化字段（[`f52537b`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/f52537b)）\n- 适配器加载层命名整顿（P1.5）（[`76a1719`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/76a1719)）\n- 网络层拆分为可注入的 HttpGateway（P1.3）（[`c2b897e`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/c2b897e)）\n- 消除 Task.project 执行期弃用警告（[`f13fcab`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/f13fcab)）\n- 迁移 AccountWorker 到 TaskScheduler 消除弃用警告（[`f7935ba`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/f7935ba)）\n- 重写任务调度为 TaskScheduler（P1.2）（[`8406ca6`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/8406ca6)）\n- 矩阵 CI 回退为单 job 全量构建（[`b2d884c`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/b2d884c)）\n\n### 性能优化\n\n- release 复用 setup-build 复合动作，去掉手写镜像参数并加产物校验（[`7da6f4d`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/7da6f4d)）\n- Loom 缓存去重——fabric-loom 归 setup-gradle 管，只留项目级 loom-cache（[`8fb3a45`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/8fb3a45)）\n\n### 文档\n\n- 同步 GUI 资源收敛与空判空约定到 AGENTS.md（[`6b947fb`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/6b947fb)）\n- 同步 AGENTS.md 反映 P1.4 头像迁出（[`6250e84`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/6250e84)）\n- 同步项目布局树补 net/ 包（P1.3）（[`e15e061`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/e15e061)）\n\n### 杂项\n\n- 版本号升至 beta.2 并去除 AGENTS.md 中的硬编码版本号（[`26189fa`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/26189fa)）\n- 杂项清理（拼写/大小写/未用导入/注解/ConfigHandle record）（[`4b5a188`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/4b5a188)）\n- bump org.ow2.asm:asm from 9.6 to 9.10.1 (#20)（[`5af1915`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/5af1915)）\n- bump io.github.llamalad7:mixinextras-fabric from 0.3.5 to 0.5.4 (#21)（[`34250d7`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/34250d7)）\n- 修正 fabric.mod.json 作者列表仅保留 Dainsleif（[`14fb9bb`](https://github.com/Dainsleif233/AccountsX/commit/14fb9bb)）\n\n..."
